{"id":"n38017-1-3","stage":3,"title":"기지개 · 懒腰","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38017-1-3-1","ko":"아침에 일어나면 가장 먼저 무엇부터 해요?","zh":"早上起床后，你首先会做些什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아침에","meaning":"早上，早晨","explanation":"아침：早上，早晨；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27368","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일어나면","meaning":"起，起床，起来","explanation":"일어나다：起，起床，起来；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"일어나다","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71696","senseId":"2","lemma":"일어나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가장","meaning":"最","explanation":"가장：最","readings":[{"term":"가장","audio":"/audio/8fd32c9572450a80df7d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26795","senseId":"1","lemma":"가장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먼저","meaning":"先","explanation":"먼저：先","readings":[{"term":"먼저","audio":"/audio/c1ddf2fcaeed84cd91ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54840","senseId":"1","lemma":"먼저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무엇부터","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무엇：什么；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"무엇","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17199","senseId":"1","lemma":"무엇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해요?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2fdd736548d881c6","term":"아침","zh":"早上，早晨","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3","entryId":"27368","definition":"从天渐渐变亮到太阳出来，一天的事情开始的时间。","pronunciation":["아침"]},{"id":"d57c47b0949440ff","term":"일어나다","zh":"起，起床，起来","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3","entryId":"71696","definition":"从睡眠中醒来。","pronunciation":["이러나다"]},{"id":"8fd32c9572450a80","term":"가장","zh":"最","audio":"/audio/8fd32c9572450a80df7d.mp3","entryId":"26795","definition":"多个中占第一。","pronunciation":["가장"]},{"id":"c1ddf2fcaeed84cd","term":"먼저","zh":"先","audio":"/audio/c1ddf2fcaeed84cd91ee.mp3","entryId":"54840","definition":"在时间或顺序上领先。","pronunciation":["먼저"]},{"id":"c95167f3fe21887b","term":"무엇","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3","entryId":"17199","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["무얻"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d041cae620d32b845169.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n38017-1-3-2","ko":"저는 기지개를 늘어지게 켜고 화장실에 가요.","zh":"我会彻底伸个懒腰，然后去洗手间。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기지개를","meaning":"懒腰","explanation":"기지개：懒腰；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"기지개","audio":"/audio/373c0b6faa8656508e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38017","senseId":"1","lemma":"기지개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"늘어지게","meaning":"痛痛快快，彻彻底底，无忧无虑","explanation":"늘어지다：痛痛快快，彻彻底底，无忧无虑；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"늘어지다","audio":"/audio/5731e3611246884ef993.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28333","senseId":"5","lemma":"늘어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"켜고","meaning":"打开，伸","explanation":"켜다：打开，伸；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"켜다","audio":"/audio/c21cbaed08b52b5bb6d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83241","senseId":"1","lemma":"켜다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"화장실에","meaning":"洗手间，卫生间","explanation":"화장실：洗手间，卫生间；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"화장실","audio":"/audio/477b8e1cccfde276bae7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30211","senseId":"1","lemma":"화장실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가요.","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"373c0b6faa865650","term":"기지개","zh":"懒腰","audio":"/audio/373c0b6faa8656508e56.mp3","entryId":"38017","definition":"张开双臂伸向上方，舒展身体和腿脚。","pronunciation":["기ː지개"]},{"id":"5731e3611246884e","term":"늘어지다","zh":"痛痛快快，彻彻底底，无忧无虑","audio":"/audio/5731e3611246884ef993.mp3","entryId":"28333","definition":"尽情地伸展身体或没有顾虑地休息。","pronunciation":["느러지다"]},{"id":"c21cbaed08b52b5b","term":"켜다","zh":"打开，伸","audio":"/audio/c21cbaed08b52b5bb6d4.mp3","entryId":"83241","definition":"伸开胳膊或腿，舒展身体。","pronunciation":["켜다"]},{"id":"477b8e1cccfde276","term":"화장실","zh":"洗手间，卫生间","audio":"/audio/477b8e1cccfde276bae7.mp3","entryId":"30211","definition":"设有供大便和小便排出体外的设施的地方。","pronunciation":["화장실"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/043a34b4150fe6e2eca4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.845,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=38017","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":101,"sequenceScore":2.6717,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["早上起床后，你首先会做些什么？","我会彻底伸个懒腰，然后去洗手间。","孩子们动作好像配合得不太好。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["早上起床后，你首先会做些什么？","我会彻底伸个懒腰，然后去洗手间。","孩子们动作好像配合得不太好。"],"answer":1}]}
